# NOTICE — TouchKeyboard.Ime.Pinyin.Extended

This package contains an embedded pinyin lexicon of about 100,000 frequent words
and phrases. It is derived from the same sources as `TouchKeyboard.Ime.Pinyin`
and generated by `tools/build-pinyin-dict.py`. It reuses the common pinyin
engine and loader; only the lexicon is larger.

